    <dashboard name="02  Definitions and trial">
      <style>
        <style-rule element="dashboard">
          <format attr="background-color" value="#F6F5F0" />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element="dash-text">
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_2" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_3" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_4" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_5" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_6" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_7" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_8" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_9" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_10" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_11" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_12" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_13" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_19" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_20" value="on" />
          <format attr="wrap" id="dash-text_21" value="on" />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight="950" maxwidth="1400" minheight="950" minwidth="1400" />
      <zones>
        <zone h="100000" id="1" type-v2="layout-basic" w="100000" x="0" y="0">
          <zone h="3368" id="200" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="4210">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="28">A bounded decision for reservations</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h="18947" id="201" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="14736">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="16">Choose a comparable hotel and arrival period, then examine market-segment counts and rates. Use lead-time bands to define a trial population. Small samples below 100 bookings need caution.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h="4842" id="202" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="36842">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="22">Population and measures</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h="18947" id="203" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="44210">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="16">One source row represents one booking. Cancellation rate = canceled bookings / bookings in the same selection. Canceled booked nights = recorded length of stay on canceled bookings. Those nights are not proven lost revenue or unfilled capacity. Exact repeats remain because the source has no booking identifier.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h="4842" id="204" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="67368">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="22">Test the recommendation</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone h="18947" id="205" type-v2="text" w="95000" x="2000" y="74736">
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor="#203b43" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="16">Within a selected hotel, segment and lead-time band, randomize an improved confirmation protocol against business-as-usual. Measure cancellation rate, staff contact workload and guest complaints. The historical snapshot cannot establish a treatment effect. Reservation fields reflect the source extraction snapshot, not guaranteed initial-booking knowledge.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid="{2139C220-68F0-49A2-AAAA-2A16F72F9A0A}" />
    </dashboard>
